@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@documentId = 1
@pdfPath = /path/to/example.pdf

### Upload a PDF (set pdfPath and enable the local demo profile)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DocFlowBoundary

--DocFlowBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< {{pdfPath}}
--DocFlowBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Example PDF
--DocFlowBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Local demonstration
--DocFlowBoundary--

### Download original content (use the upload response ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/content
Accept: application/pdf

### Processing status (DEFERRED is not queued)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/processing

### List metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents

### Get metadata (replace documentId with the returned ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}

### Replace editable metadata; null clears description
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/metadata
Content-Type: application/json

{"filename":"renamed.pdf","contentType":"application/pdf","description":null,"title":"Updated invoice"}

### Validation problem
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/metadata
Content-Type: application/json

{"filename":"","contentType":"application/pdf"}

### Delete metadata
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}

### Generated OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs
